{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Medians <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> are perpendicular, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e491294491036a473e5229c66217003aa9bd9946.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD=8$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/e/2fedb75fb84abe069e24a618a61411024b06b50c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />.  The area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0fa86e3c4a1430fc804dcaddd4a346d89ca0c0f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); dotfactor=4; pair A = origin; pair B = (1.25,1); pair C = (2,0); pair D = midpoint(A--C); pair E = midpoint(A--B); pair G = intersectionpoint(E--C,B--D); dot(A);dot(B);dot(C);dot(D);dot(E);dot(G); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,S);label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,N);label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,S);label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S);label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,NW);label(&quot;$G$&quot;,G,NE); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(B--D); draw(E--C); draw(rightanglemark(C,G,D,3));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/c/07c200b16ac6a3cbb13a147e4a35512251f12fae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 24\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 32\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 64\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acccc291b5626d64877734020e9e2e0750df4263.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); dotfactor=4; pair A = origin; pair B = (1.25,1); pair C = (2,0); pair D = midpoint(A--C); pair E = midpoint(A--B); pair F = midpoint(B--C); pair G = intersectionpoint(E--C,B--D); dot(A);dot(B);dot(C);dot(D);dot(E);dot(G);dot(F); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,S);label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,N);label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,S);label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S);label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,NW);label(&quot;$G$&quot;,G,NE);label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,NE); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(B--D); draw(E--C); draw(A--F); draw(rightanglemark(B,G,E,3));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\n</p><p>One median divides a triangle into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equal areas, so all three medians will divide a triangle into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equal areas.\n</p><p>The median <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is divided into a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b3714d1977e2e6fa2c03536bd04eabab371fd18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" /> ratio at centroid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c2947e65d372ff44565eaa5d92bc93c4ca1cd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GE = \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot CE = \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 12 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"210\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b878a7e6a84ad474318fa177f489a3336a2126e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BG = \\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 8 = \\frac{16}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"133\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>The area of the right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c942919d70e33a4ff5de57738694c1d66d143ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BEG$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872c8aba3e3874fe602aafc16588f57e7d6b88aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{16}{3}\\cdot 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>The area of the whole figure is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717968502c8a238ffc3dcef01408767cb3952cfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{16}{3}\\cdot 4 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"37\" />, and the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that if you were to draw in line ED, you would get an orthodiagonal quadrilateral with diagonals 8 and 12. The area is going to be equal to 48. Now we need to examine the triangle AED. If the area we are trying to find is denoted as A, we can tell that the area of AEC is A/2. The area of AED is going to be half of that since AD = DC so it would be A/4. This means that 48 is 3/4 of A, so naturally A is going to be 64. Giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href